{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_040fc98f7f8dd987-1299\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>想在家裡做出媲美酒家的滑溜魚腐？黃永幟（幟哥）在《在家宴客50道菜》中大秀哥級廚藝，教大家製作鮮味可口的「龍蝦湯魚腐」！這道菜巧妙運用「三炒三滾」的方法熬製濃縮龍蝦湯，再搭配加入白飯與炸米的獨特配搭，帶來多重豐富口感！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_040fc98f7f8dd987-1299\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cdf97f2a-52d1-486a-aa9a-1715d812e30b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026fNwsg0H6du1789636134.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cdf97f2a-52d1-486a-aa9a-1715d812e30b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>魚腐材料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; ma